{"3174340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soulsearch", "steam_appid": 3174340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Soulsearch&quot; is an action game set in a fictional world of immortal heroes. In this game, you will play as &quot;Sheng,&quot; a person who was originally dead but mysteriously revived within an eerie ritual array. Having forgotten everything before death, and with no knowledge of current whereabouts, the only choice is to venture deeper into this unknown realm and seek a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Scenic Beauty</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the breathtaking landscapes throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/45cb807f615be9e42d34940be5fa6977.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/45cb807f615be9e42d34940be5fa6977.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Talismans</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of consumable Talismans are available in the game for you to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/15ee01cd3c7fbc7b5bdebb2614b49b42.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/15ee01cd3c7fbc7b5bdebb2614b49b42.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Treasure Talismans</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These special &quot;Talismans&quot; are refined from Magic Treasures—powerful artifacts wielded by senior cultivators. They are far more potent than ordinary Talismans. Each Treasure Talisman is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single Treasure Talisman can be used multiple times and is often the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/ba29eefe85162afc093b0c4e0e9d5ecc.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/ba29eefe85162afc093b0c4e0e9d5ecc.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Combat</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos, dodges, Talismans, and Treasure Talismans. Master the flexible use of different skills and items to achieve brilliant victories in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/917eb7168986312c16780b582f2551ea.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/917eb7168986312c16780b582f2551ea.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=467 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Soulsearch&quot; is an action game set in a fictional world of immortal heroes. In this game, you will play as &quot;Sheng,&quot; a person who was originally dead but mysteriously revived within an eerie ritual array. Having forgotten everything before death, and with no knowledge of current whereabouts, the only choice is to venture deeper into this unknown realm and seek a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Scenic Beauty</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the breathtaking landscapes throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/45cb807f615be9e42d34940be5fa6977.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/45cb807f615be9e42d34940be5fa6977.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Talismans</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of consumable Talismans are available in the game for you to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/15ee01cd3c7fbc7b5bdebb2614b49b42.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/15ee01cd3c7fbc7b5bdebb2614b49b42.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Treasure Talismans</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These special &quot;Talismans&quot; are refined from Magic Treasures—powerful artifacts wielded by senior cultivators. They are far more potent than ordinary Talismans. Each Treasure Talisman is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single Treasure Talisman can be used multiple times and is often the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/ba29eefe85162afc093b0c4e0e9d5ecc.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/ba29eefe85162afc093b0c4e0e9d5ecc.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Combat</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos, dodges, Talismans, and Treasure Talismans. Master the flexible use of different skills and items to achieve brilliant victories in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras/917eb7168986312c16780b582f2551ea.avif?t=1770455414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/extras_big/917eb7168986312c16780b582f2551ea.webp?t=1770455414 width=1560 height=467 /></span></p>", "short_description": "One who returned from death awakens within an eerie ritual array, forgetting all past memories, only to discover their body is now inhabited by another soul. &quot;Who am I? Am I still myself?&quot; All will be unveiled gradually throughout the game...", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/843fe7e866b83e2159244b06f17f7d3346a6c098/header.jpg?t=1770455414", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/ad526675888763d22bd78dd872dc6cce80be3014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770455414", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174340/ad526675888763d22bd78dd872dc6cce80be3014/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770455414", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 兼容 Windows 的音频设备</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700 / AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT / INTEL 